WEBVTT

00:14.806 --> 00:17.100
Green Dolphin Street Prison.

00:17.684 --> 00:19.185
Also known as "The Aquarium."

00:19.769 --> 00:21.521
At some point in time,

00:21.604 --> 00:23.648
it had birthed mystery and power.

00:24.232 --> 00:26.860
Something unseen by ordinary men.

00:27.444 --> 00:31.239
Power and mystery drenched in filth.

00:34.993 --> 00:38.163
PUNISHMENT WARD

00:38.747 --> 00:40.123
Jolyne got five added years

00:40.206 --> 00:44.127
for her jailbreak and has been in
the Punishment Ward for a few weeks.

00:44.794 --> 00:46.337
Everything will start afterward...

00:47.047 --> 00:48.339
Everything.

00:50.008 --> 00:50.967
INFIRMARY WARD

00:51.551 --> 00:54.763
Before that, I must investigate something.

00:55.430 --> 00:57.015
It concerns another inmate.

00:59.017 --> 01:00.310
Her name is…

01:01.352 --> 01:02.771
Ermes Costello.

01:08.026 --> 01:11.404
Jolyne has already met her.

01:12.113 --> 01:14.616
Hey! What the hell
do you think you're doing?

01:14.699 --> 01:17.118
Hey! I'm talking to you, bastard!

01:23.041 --> 01:24.584
Is this...

01:25.418 --> 01:26.544
the infirmary?

03:03.266 --> 03:04.434
EPISODE 6: ERMES'S STICKERS

03:04.517 --> 03:06.227
Shit! That was the bathroom janitor.

03:06.311 --> 03:08.646
That was my hard-earned money.

03:08.730 --> 03:10.523
Dammit!

03:11.024 --> 03:13.526
Oh, I'm starting to remember now.

03:14.235 --> 03:16.988
I hurt my right palm.

03:17.822 --> 03:19.324
I had a fever too.

03:19.908 --> 03:22.160
But my hand is almost completely healed.

03:23.411 --> 03:24.579
Was I dreaming?

03:25.079 --> 03:26.664
Hold on.

03:27.332 --> 03:29.250
It's coming back to me now.

03:29.334 --> 03:31.336
Right before I got sent here

03:31.419 --> 03:35.215
to serve five years
for the robbery I committed,

03:35.798 --> 03:37.800
I picked up that charm.

03:39.636 --> 03:41.679
It was in the washroom
of the holding cell.

03:42.722 --> 03:47.060
But that charm cut my hand,
so I got pissed and sold it to…

03:47.143 --> 03:49.812
What was her name again?

03:50.563 --> 03:53.650
Oh, I think she's called Gwess.
Anyway, I sold it off to her.

03:54.442 --> 03:56.027
And that night…

03:57.153 --> 03:58.988
something caused me to pass out.

03:59.072 --> 04:00.490
I've been held here since.

04:01.074 --> 04:03.243
Have I been bedridden since?

04:04.327 --> 04:05.954
My hand is better too.

04:12.502 --> 04:13.878
Hold on, what just…

04:17.799 --> 04:22.345
Just now, I peeled off
this sticker from my palm.

04:22.929 --> 04:24.764
Is my memory okay?

04:25.556 --> 04:28.601
In 1492, Columbus discovers the Americas.

04:28.685 --> 04:31.729
Bugs Bunny's birthday is July 27th.

04:31.813 --> 04:33.356
No, my memory's fine.

04:33.982 --> 04:34.983
What the…

04:35.483 --> 04:37.235
I'm sure I peeled it off just now.

04:39.737 --> 04:42.657
Wait, what? My shoes…

04:42.740 --> 04:45.493
There are…

04:45.576 --> 04:47.453
One, two…

04:49.706 --> 04:52.542
three, four, five, six…

04:52.625 --> 04:55.211
Huh? What?

04:56.337 --> 04:57.797
Ouch!

04:57.880 --> 05:00.967
Ah, five of them? They're back to normal.

05:01.050 --> 05:04.762
Did the high fever cause astigmatism?!

05:04.846 --> 05:06.514
But that sticker just now...

05:08.975 --> 05:11.102
That's the sticker I tossed aside.

05:12.353 --> 05:13.187
No way…

05:14.981 --> 05:16.691
Gross!

05:17.275 --> 05:20.153
-What are you hollering about?
-Keep it down, will you?

05:20.236 --> 05:22.947
It's nothing. Go back to sleep.

05:24.032 --> 05:24.907
Shit.

05:26.200 --> 05:27.327
No.

05:27.410 --> 05:30.580
I didn't get astigmatism from my fever.

05:31.372 --> 05:34.125
I'm definitely touching the shoe,
and I feel its weight.

05:34.208 --> 05:35.668
This sticker…

05:35.752 --> 05:39.172
When I attach it to an object,
the object is duplicated.

05:39.255 --> 05:40.173
Once you peel it,

05:42.467 --> 05:45.345
there's a bit of destruction,
but it merges back into one.

05:46.054 --> 05:47.805
And this sticker…

05:47.889 --> 05:50.683
I know it sounds crazy,
but there's no doubt about it.

05:50.767 --> 05:54.520
It emerged from inside my body!

06:00.693 --> 06:01.819
And

06:01.903 --> 06:05.031
now that I've accepted it,
it's quite useful.

06:16.167 --> 06:17.585
This is awesome.

06:17.668 --> 06:19.420
No point in overthinking it.

06:20.046 --> 06:22.090
This sticker emerges from my palm.

06:22.173 --> 06:23.633
This is reality.

06:23.716 --> 06:24.717
Asshole.

06:24.801 --> 06:26.928
Give me my money back.

06:32.058 --> 06:35.603
What is this…

06:42.652 --> 06:45.196
He left…

06:45.905 --> 06:48.491
He didn't seem to notice it.

06:48.574 --> 06:51.494
I grabbed it without thinking.

06:52.495 --> 06:54.080
This disc…

06:54.163 --> 06:55.915
What does it do?

06:59.460 --> 07:01.295
Your fever has gone down.

07:01.379 --> 07:03.339
You may now return to your cell.

07:03.423 --> 07:05.383
Well, I have a question.

07:06.384 --> 07:08.094
The bathroom janitor.

07:08.177 --> 07:10.012
Is he a model prisoner? What's his--

07:10.096 --> 07:12.265
And what will you do
with that information?

07:12.348 --> 07:13.641
Next!

07:14.267 --> 07:15.601
The janitor inmate?

07:15.685 --> 07:17.145
How the hell should I know?

07:17.937 --> 07:19.856
No idea.

07:26.404 --> 07:29.073
It's not a CD,

07:29.157 --> 07:30.908
but it's shaped like one

07:30.992 --> 07:33.786
and even reflects light like a disc.

07:33.870 --> 07:37.081
But it's soft and elastic.

07:37.165 --> 07:38.040
Also,

07:38.124 --> 07:41.461
I saw another disc on his face.

07:41.544 --> 07:43.504
There were two of these on him.

07:45.047 --> 07:47.592
What's this? It's projecting something.

07:48.342 --> 07:51.262
The money I took from the sick inmates.

07:51.345 --> 07:52.346
They're mine now.

07:53.848 --> 07:55.725
All 5,000 dollars.

07:55.808 --> 07:57.643
No one will ever find them here.

07:57.727 --> 07:59.770
This image…

08:03.774 --> 08:05.651
McQueen.

08:05.735 --> 08:08.196
Would you like to cooperate

08:08.279 --> 08:10.072
as my partner?

08:10.156 --> 08:11.741
McQueen!

08:16.120 --> 08:17.997
What did I just see?

08:18.080 --> 08:20.374
It's as if I was watching
someone's memory!

08:20.458 --> 08:21.959
I heard…

08:22.919 --> 08:25.838
you've been sneaking around
asking about me.

08:26.714 --> 08:28.799
I've stalked before,

08:28.883 --> 08:32.053
but I've never been stalked by a woman.

08:32.136 --> 08:34.639
Yes, this is a first.

08:34.722 --> 08:36.557
And who the hell are you?

08:37.183 --> 08:38.351
I saw

08:38.434 --> 08:40.728
those discs sticking out of your face!

08:40.811 --> 08:41.771
Discs?

08:46.734 --> 08:47.568
What?

08:50.863 --> 08:54.534
I can't remember a thing! What discs?

08:54.617 --> 08:56.202
I'm such a loser!

08:56.285 --> 08:58.120
I can't remember a thing!

08:58.204 --> 09:01.499
What got you crying all of a sudden?

09:01.582 --> 09:04.418
You took my money at the infirmary.

09:04.502 --> 09:05.419
Just this morning!

09:05.503 --> 09:08.130
Money? That's right.

09:08.214 --> 09:11.676
I had a huge sum of money,
and I hid it somewhere.

09:11.759 --> 09:12.635
But…

09:12.718 --> 09:14.220
I forgot where I hid it!

09:14.303 --> 09:16.722
Hey, are you all right?

09:16.806 --> 09:18.766
Are you messing with me?

09:20.476 --> 09:22.436
Did you just ask if I'm okay?

09:24.313 --> 09:26.607
How nice!

09:26.691 --> 09:29.986
It's been ages since
I last spoke with a woman!

09:30.861 --> 09:33.072
No, it's a first.

09:33.155 --> 09:38.828
I've never had a heartfelt conversation
with a woman before.

09:38.911 --> 09:41.497
I'm in bliss right now.

09:42.290 --> 09:47.253
I hope I can spend the rest of my life
with a wonderful lady like you someday.

09:47.336 --> 09:48.212
What the hell?

09:48.296 --> 09:52.008
But that'll never happen.

09:52.091 --> 09:54.218
I'm pathetic, aren't I?

09:54.885 --> 09:56.679
Yes, I'm trash.

09:57.263 --> 09:58.389
I want to die.

09:59.181 --> 10:00.141
What…

10:00.766 --> 10:03.728
What the hell are you doing?

10:06.772 --> 10:08.608
What is this?

10:08.691 --> 10:10.860
This thing!

10:15.072 --> 10:16.949
STAND NAME: FREEWAY THRU HELL
STAND MASTER: THUNDER MCQUEEN

10:20.077 --> 10:22.204
McQueen…

10:22.288 --> 10:24.874
You have pure evil within you.

10:26.292 --> 10:30.046
You have no malice or animosity.

10:30.129 --> 10:33.966
You think you don't inconvenience others.

10:34.050 --> 10:37.053
You victimize yourself,

10:37.136 --> 10:39.013
and you have no interest in others,

10:39.096 --> 10:43.392
yet you're always wishing
for someone to save you.

10:43.476 --> 10:47.104
But that's precisely why
you are the worst.

10:47.188 --> 10:50.316
You drag others down with you.

10:50.399 --> 10:52.443
You are the purest form of evil.

10:52.526 --> 10:56.614
I really like you, McQueen.

10:56.697 --> 11:00.951
If you ever find my enemies
within these prison walls,

11:01.035 --> 11:05.748
you will surely clean them out
and take care of them for me.

11:07.166 --> 11:09.418
Dammit! He hanged himself...

11:09.502 --> 11:10.920
and now my neck...

11:14.799 --> 11:16.342
Someone!

11:16.425 --> 11:17.802
Someone help!

11:20.137 --> 11:21.180
I'm passing out...

11:21.931 --> 11:25.393
Maybe if I bring his body down,
my body will be lowered too?

11:27.144 --> 11:28.270
Sticker.

11:38.239 --> 11:40.533
He has strange powers like I do.

11:40.616 --> 11:42.702
So there are others like me!

11:42.785 --> 11:44.370
Dammit.

11:44.453 --> 11:46.288
Just who the hell are you?

11:46.372 --> 11:47.957
Why did you hang yourself?

11:48.791 --> 11:51.043
Did you save me?

11:51.919 --> 11:54.130
I owe my life to you.

11:54.839 --> 11:57.133
Who the hell are you?

11:57.216 --> 11:59.885
What do you want from me?

11:59.969 --> 12:03.139
I know you have some sort of ability!

12:03.806 --> 12:04.807
An ability?

12:04.890 --> 12:06.642
I don't know what you mean.

12:06.726 --> 12:07.727
But don't worry.

12:07.810 --> 12:09.812
I won't do that again.

12:09.895 --> 12:11.355
I can see clearly now.

12:11.439 --> 12:14.942
And I owe you for saving my life.

12:15.025 --> 12:17.486
I'll repay you someday.

12:17.570 --> 12:20.448
Don't worry about that.

12:20.531 --> 12:22.074
It was nothing.

12:23.492 --> 12:25.953
What the hell are you doing?

12:28.998 --> 12:30.875
What is this?

12:36.130 --> 12:37.089
Those scars…

12:38.048 --> 12:40.050
He must have suicidal tendencies!

12:40.134 --> 12:43.971
And he himself is unaware of his ability.

12:44.054 --> 12:45.431
This is bad.

12:46.015 --> 12:48.392
I'm even in the same position as him.

12:48.476 --> 12:51.353
Dammit, I'm farther away from him now.

12:51.437 --> 12:54.356
You bastard!

12:57.568 --> 13:00.488
Dammit!

13:08.579 --> 13:09.663
The disc!

13:09.747 --> 13:12.583
I don't understand what's going on,

13:12.666 --> 13:14.919
but it's got to do something
with those discs!

13:17.755 --> 13:18.839
Let me die.

13:19.423 --> 13:21.425
I said I'd repay you,

13:21.509 --> 13:24.094
but a guy like me
would never be able to do that

13:24.178 --> 13:25.971
because I'm trash!

13:26.055 --> 13:30.100
I don't want anything to do with you!

13:30.184 --> 13:32.311
Stay away from me, or I'll kill you!

13:32.394 --> 13:34.230
Please do!

13:34.313 --> 13:37.358
I wouldn't mind being killed
by a beautiful woman like you!

13:45.616 --> 13:50.621
It looked like she picked up
a disc from the bathroom floor.

13:51.121 --> 13:55.125
For some reason,
I think it belonged to me.

13:55.209 --> 13:56.919
I wonder if she'll give it back.

13:57.419 --> 14:00.297
No, probably not.

14:00.381 --> 14:01.799
Let me pass!

14:02.383 --> 14:05.761
I have permission to leave.
I'm returning to the women's prison.

14:07.555 --> 14:09.139
Dammit!

14:09.223 --> 14:12.059
I need to get as far away
from that psycho as possible.

14:12.560 --> 14:13.936
I need to get back

14:14.520 --> 14:15.604
to my cell.

14:22.611 --> 14:23.821
I knew it.

14:24.488 --> 14:25.948
So your powers have awakened.

14:27.741 --> 14:31.579
I'll tell you one thing.
That power that awakened within you…

14:31.662 --> 14:34.790
It's called a Stand ability.

14:36.166 --> 14:40.754
Stand abilities are drawn
to one another like gravity.

14:40.838 --> 14:42.172
It happens without reason.

14:42.965 --> 14:46.218
That's why you ran into that janitor.

14:46.802 --> 14:48.470
Why is there a kid?!

14:49.138 --> 14:52.474
You picked up and sold Jolyne's charm.

14:52.975 --> 14:58.397
That's why she told me
to keep an eye on you.

14:58.480 --> 14:59.857
You know Jolyne?

15:00.816 --> 15:02.484
What happened to her?

15:02.568 --> 15:06.447
Our enemy has the ability to steal souls.

15:06.530 --> 15:09.158
We are looking for a soul he stole.

15:10.117 --> 15:10.951
A soul?

15:11.035 --> 15:13.621
The culprit's name is Pale Snake.

15:13.704 --> 15:16.081
Please tell me anything you know.

15:17.875 --> 15:19.168
Soul?

15:20.169 --> 15:23.505
Could you be talking about this disc?

15:23.589 --> 15:25.132
That disc!

15:26.592 --> 15:28.344
This belongs to the janitor.

15:28.427 --> 15:30.596
What's the significance of these discs?

15:30.679 --> 15:33.265
Did he have two discs?

15:33.349 --> 15:36.518
Two discs? He did.

15:36.602 --> 15:38.729
A memory disc and a Stand disc.

15:38.812 --> 15:40.814
Discs come in pairs.

15:40.898 --> 15:42.358
Two discs make up a soul.

15:43.525 --> 15:45.361
If only we can get his other disc,

15:45.444 --> 15:47.947
we may be able to learn
the identity of Pale Snake!

15:48.447 --> 15:49.990
Hell no…

15:50.074 --> 15:51.367
No way!

15:52.952 --> 15:54.787
It's still following me around.

15:55.663 --> 15:58.123
Dammit! I thought I got far enough.

16:01.418 --> 16:04.213
What's happening?

16:05.381 --> 16:07.841
Electricity! That bastard!

16:07.925 --> 16:10.344
He's electrocuting himself!

16:11.428 --> 16:13.639
It... It stopped.

16:14.223 --> 16:15.975
Electrical resistance.

16:16.058 --> 16:21.981
You can't kill a person just by sending
100 volts of electricity on human skin.

16:22.064 --> 16:24.108
We have electrical resistance.

16:24.692 --> 16:26.235
That's why it stopped.

16:26.318 --> 16:28.487
His suicide attempt failed.

16:28.570 --> 16:29.488
But…

16:30.447 --> 16:33.283
if he wants to electrocute himself again,

16:33.367 --> 16:36.704
he'd be looking around
for some saline solution right about now.

16:37.454 --> 16:41.500
Saline solution would increase
conductivity to almost 100 percent.

16:41.583 --> 16:45.087
Electricity can pierce
and burn the heart completely.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.672
Saline solution?

16:46.755 --> 16:48.966
They are used as IVs and disinfectants.

16:49.049 --> 16:51.301
There's a bunch by the infirmary!

16:52.011 --> 16:53.887
I can't go any further.

16:54.847 --> 16:58.934
There are too many inmates by the stairs!

16:59.643 --> 17:03.480
I'll beat him up and take his other disc.

17:03.564 --> 17:04.815
That's my only way!

17:15.117 --> 17:16.869
Stop! Don't do this!

17:17.453 --> 17:19.747
Look at my left arm!

17:20.456 --> 17:24.334
It's a little burnt, just like your arm.

17:24.418 --> 17:26.754
You have obtained a strange ability.

17:26.837 --> 17:31.467
Every suicide attempt
is reflected onto me!

17:32.051 --> 17:33.761
Don't think about suicide!

17:33.844 --> 17:36.680
There are lots of fun
and lucky things in life too!

17:41.810 --> 17:43.896
Four years ago,

17:45.105 --> 17:46.732
I was only cleaning.

17:48.317 --> 17:51.737
Cleaning the shotgun in my apartment.

17:52.362 --> 17:55.824
But for some reason, the gun was loaded.

17:57.576 --> 17:58.994
The gun accidentally fired.

17:59.620 --> 18:01.789
I live on the tenth floor.

18:01.872 --> 18:05.626
Just as the gun went off,
a woman jumped to kill herself.

18:07.044 --> 18:08.295
It was like the lottery.

18:08.879 --> 18:10.964
While some win millions of dollars,

18:11.048 --> 18:13.967
I guess sometimes
the exact opposite happens.

18:14.051 --> 18:18.013
She was supposed to
hit the ground and die.

18:19.139 --> 18:24.144
Everyone thought that I aimed at
and killed the woman on the 11th floor.

18:24.228 --> 18:27.606
The judge even called me cold-blooded.

18:28.107 --> 18:30.192
That's the kind of man I am!

18:30.275 --> 18:31.610
Hold on!

18:31.693 --> 18:33.153
Oh, panties.

18:33.237 --> 18:35.197
Has anyone given you panties before?

18:35.280 --> 18:39.201
Wouldn't you feel lucky
if a girl gave you her panties?

18:40.327 --> 18:42.454
You're going through
tough times right now.

18:42.538 --> 18:43.914
But imagine.

18:43.997 --> 18:45.874
If a girl gives you panties,

18:45.958 --> 18:49.711
that means lucky things can happen
even at the worst moment.

18:49.795 --> 18:52.047
Oh, I'm so embarrassed!

18:52.131 --> 18:53.674
But you can have it.

18:53.757 --> 18:56.051
I'll give you the one I got on right now!

18:59.012 --> 19:00.430
You'll really give me your panties?

19:01.807 --> 19:04.268
I keep my promises.

19:04.351 --> 19:05.519
But remember this.

19:05.602 --> 19:09.064
Everyone hates Mondays.

19:09.148 --> 19:13.235
We all hope for
the fun Saturdays to come around.

19:13.318 --> 19:15.821
Not every day is a Monday!

19:15.904 --> 19:18.448
I was arrested on a Saturday.

19:19.241 --> 19:24.037
You're saying nice things to give me hope,

19:24.663 --> 19:29.084
but I bet it's just lip service
to save yourself.

19:29.168 --> 19:30.836
That's not…

19:30.919 --> 19:33.463
You are pretending to be kind

19:33.547 --> 19:36.341
just to get out of this situation.

19:36.425 --> 19:39.011
You don't mean a word you say.

19:39.094 --> 19:40.095
Am I wrong?

19:41.388 --> 19:45.976
That's how everyone always treats me.

19:46.059 --> 19:48.061
Nobody likes trash.

19:48.145 --> 19:49.771
But I'm worse than trash.

19:49.855 --> 19:54.401
My presence is invisible to everyone!

19:54.484 --> 19:56.278
Hold on!

19:56.361 --> 20:00.324
Yes, I'm talking to you
because I don't want to die.

20:00.407 --> 20:02.701
But listen up.

20:02.784 --> 20:05.537
You are being used by Pale Snake.

20:05.621 --> 20:07.956
He's exploiting your mindset!

20:08.040 --> 20:10.792
If you don't think about suicide,

20:10.876 --> 20:13.170
nothing will happen!

20:13.253 --> 20:17.716
You are the one who's being selfish,

20:17.799 --> 20:20.052
you bastard!

20:24.473 --> 20:27.100
You really are a nice person.

20:27.768 --> 20:29.311
How wonderful.

20:29.394 --> 20:31.480
Those words were sincere.

20:31.563 --> 20:34.149
I sure am fortunate.

20:34.691 --> 20:38.195
I ran into such
a beautiful woman before my passing.

20:39.404 --> 20:42.074
Thank you!

20:42.157 --> 20:43.951
If I can die with you…

20:44.034 --> 20:46.453
If I can spend an eternity with you,

20:46.536 --> 20:50.290
then I'm really blessed!

20:50.374 --> 20:53.252
He's evil.

20:53.335 --> 20:55.420
He is, without a doubt,

20:55.504 --> 20:58.048
rotten to his core!

20:58.674 --> 21:01.510
I'm not lonely!

21:02.094 --> 21:07.307
-Here!
-Bastard! Let go of that switch!

21:17.651 --> 21:18.902
That was close.

21:18.986 --> 21:21.113
Too close, dammit!

21:21.697 --> 21:23.490
I managed to attach the sticker.

21:23.573 --> 21:26.451
It'll burn from the sparks of electricity.

21:26.535 --> 21:28.578
Once the sticker burns off,

21:28.662 --> 21:32.082
the copy created with the sticker will…

21:33.458 --> 21:34.543
merge back to one!

21:44.011 --> 21:46.096
Goddammit.

21:46.179 --> 21:48.140
The shock made me remember.

21:49.141 --> 21:53.228
He hid the money he stole, 5,000 dollars.

21:53.729 --> 21:56.398
I'll take it as payment, you little shit.

21:57.024 --> 21:59.443
And then there's Pale Snake.

21:59.526 --> 22:01.486
I went through this because of him.

22:01.570 --> 22:03.530
Just what are you planning?

22:03.613 --> 22:09.244
ERMES COSTELLO, STAND NAME: "SMACK"

22:09.828 --> 22:12.080
I have to go see her. Jolyne…

22:13.206 --> 22:15.083
Jolyne Cujoh.

23:41.378 --> 23:46.383
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
